      "text": "```\nCORAL REEF SYSTEM — ARCHITECTURE AND ENERGY FLOW\n=================================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "03-CORAL-REEFS.md#004",
      "path": [
        "03-CORAL-REEFS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:marine-biology:03-coral-reefs, git-history:marine-biology:03-coral-reefs]",
        "canonical_path": "marine-biology/03-CORAL-REEFS.md",
        "concepts": "[coral, reefs]",
        "current_path": "marine-biology/03-CORAL-REEFS.md",
        "id": "maxim:marine-biology:coral-reefs",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "marine-biology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[coral, reefs]",
        "section": "marine-biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Coral Reef Ecosystems",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "OPEN OCEAN                    REEF SYSTEM                    LAND\n(oligotrophic)                                               (runoff)\n    ↓ Waves                 ┌──────────────────────┐\n    ↓ low nutrients         │  FORE REEF           │  ←─── Wave energy\n                            │  (steep drop-off)    │\n                            │  Coral spurs,        │\n                            │  buttresses, grooves  │\n                            │  (dissipate wave      │\n                            │   energy)             │\n                            └──────────┬───────────┘\n                                       │\n                            ┌──────────┴───────────┐\n                            │  REEF CREST          │\n                            │  (shallowest, most   │\n                            │   wave energy, most  │\n                            │   light, hardiest    │\n                            │   coral species)     │\n                            └──────────┬───────────┘\n                                       │\n                            ┌──────────┴───────────┐\n                            │  BACK REEF /         │\n                            │  REEF FLAT           │\n                            │  (calm, warm, some   │\n                            │   sand, sediment)    │\n                            └──────────┬───────────┘\n                                       │\n                            ┌──────────┴───────────┐\n                            │  LAGOON              │\n                            │  (sheltered, warm,   │\n                            │   sandy substrate,   │\n                            │   seagrass beds,     │\n                            │   patch reefs)       │\n                            └──────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-CORAL-REEFS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "03-CORAL-REEFS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
