      "text": "Ocean acidification: CO₂ + H₂O → H₂CO₃ → H⁺ + HCO₃⁻\n  H⁺ reacts with CO₃²⁻ → HCO₃⁻ (reducing CO₃²⁻ availability)\n  → Ω_arag decreases → calcification slows → skeleton weakens\n```"
