      "text": "```\nCORAL-ZOOXANTHELLAE SYMBIOSIS\n=============================="
    },
    {
      "id": "03-CORAL-REEFS.md#019",
      "path": [
        "03-CORAL-REEFS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:marine-biology:03-coral-reefs, git-history:marine-biology:03-coral-reefs]",
        "canonical_path": "marine-biology/03-CORAL-REEFS.md",
        "concepts": "[coral, reefs]",
        "current_path": "marine-biology/03-CORAL-REEFS.md",
        "id": "maxim:marine-biology:coral-reefs",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "marine-biology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[coral, reefs]",
        "section": "marine-biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Coral Reef Ecosystems",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ZOOXANTHELLAE IN TISSUE\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  Symbiodinium sp. (dinoflagellate)             │\n  │  ~2–5 μm diameter; lives in gastrodermal cells │\n  │  ~1–2 million cells per cm² of coral tissue    │\n  │                                                │\n  │  Photosynthesis:                               │\n  │  CO₂ + H₂O + light → glucose + O₂              │\n  │                          │                     │\n  │                          ▼                     │\n  │              Translocates 90-99% of            │\n  │              photosynthate to coral host       │\n  │              (glucose, glycerol, amino acids)  │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                  ↕ mutualism\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  CORAL HOST provides:                          │\n  │  CO₂ (from respiration)                        │\n  │  NH₄⁺ (nitrogen — limiting nutrient)           │\n  │  PO₄³⁻ (phosphorus)                            │\n  │  Physical shelter inside cell                  │\n  │  Light access (thin tissue, light orientation) │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
